  "authority": {
    "owner_approved": false,
    "statement": "The contributor, to whom issue #186 is assigned, paid for these runs on the contributor's own RunPod account and set the cap. No owner approved a budget, a cap or the provider: #184 says that paid GPU runs need an owner-approved budget, #186 puts unbudgeted GPU runs out of scope, and research/AUTHORITY.json lists Modal, Vast.ai and Hugging Face Jobs, not RunPod; docs/OPERATIONS.md says to stop before a paid job for which no authority exists. No authority record was made or changed. #186's box 'GPU spend recorded against an owner-approved cap' is not met by a contributor's cap",
